  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-051 (PR #263) needs this state captured, to confirm a flag or favourite write on real HFR answers. Until then the write reports `unconfirmed` and never success.\n\nState: the message_forum_delflags answer from the favourites list, once with one row and once with several rows. Ideally also the body a browser sends from a two-row list with one box checked (end-marker position: legacy puts it at index 1, the R10 form after the last row).\n\nNOTE: these are logged-in writes to the account's own flags and favourites. They change no public content, but they still need the operator's go before they run.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- Request and answer captured, anonymized, with a MANIFEST row.\n- docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md §6c, LOT-051 subsection: row settled.\n- LOT-051 tests read the capture.",
